#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:170
msgid "Frosted glass over each system's colours."
msgstr "Frosted glass over each system's colors."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:680
msgid "Bicubic is sharp, Bicubic Hermite a little softer, Bilinear softest. Nearest neighbour keeps pixels square. AMD FSR 1 keeps edges clean for games below 4K, at a small GPU cost."
msgstr "Bicubic is sharp, Bicubic Hermite a little softer, Bilinear softest. Nearest neighbor keeps pixels square. AMD FSR 1 keeps edges clean for games below 4K, at a small GPU cost."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:762
msgid "Shows the 3DS's 3D for red and cyan glasses, with the 3D slider all the way up. Colours change with it. Applies to the next game."
msgstr "Shows the 3DS's 3D for red and cyan glasses, with the 3D slider all the way up. Colors change with it. Applies to the next game."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1517
msgid "The launcher's colours, corners and background. Make your own as a JSON file in {0}/themes; the text below this page says how. Games and in-game menus don't change."
msgstr "The launcher's colors, corners and background. Make your own as a JSON file in {0}/themes; the text below this page says how. Games and in-game menus don't change."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1578
msgid "The selected game's picture fills the background, blurred and dimmed. Off: just the game's colours."
msgstr "The selected game's picture fills the background, blurred and dimmed. Off: just the game's colors."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1579
msgid "A row of filters above the list."
msgstr "A row of filters above the list."

#: port/frontend/shell/settings.cpp:1580
msgid "Filters above the list: All, Recently added (last 30 days), Favourites, and for Wii U, Graphic packs on. Off: just Sort and Search."
msgstr "Filters above the list: All, Recently added (last 30 days), Favorites, and for Wii U, Graphic packs on. Off: just Sort and Search."

